  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Combination Lock</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n    <h1 id=\"title\">Pixel Lock</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Enter the 3-digit combination</p>\n    <div class=\"dials\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Combination dials\">\n      <div class=\"dial\" data-index=\"0\">\n        <button class=\"up\" aria-label=\"Increase first digit\">▲</button>\n        <div class=\"digit\" id=\"digit0\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</div>\n        <button class=\"down\" aria-label=\"Decrease first digit\">▼</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dial\" data-index=\"1\">\n        <button class=\"up\" aria-label=\"Increase second digit\">▲</button>\n        <div class=\"digit\" id=\"digit1\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</div>\n        <button class=\"down\" aria-label=\"Decrease second digit\">▼</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dial\" data-index=\"2\">\n        <button class=\"up\" aria-label=\"Increase third digit\">▲</button>\n        <div class=\"digit\" id=\"digit2\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</div>\n        <button class=\"down\" aria-label=\"Decrease third digit\">▼</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"openBtn\" class=\"open\">Open</button>\n    <p class=\"attempts\" id=\"attempts\">Failed attempts: <span id=\"failCount\">0</span></p>\n    <p class=\"message\" id=\"message\" aria-live=\"assertive\"></p>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML structure"
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  background: #1a1a2e;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #16213e;\n  border: 2px solid #0f3460;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  max-width: 480px;\n  width: 100%;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  color: #e94560;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n  color: #a0a0b0;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\n.dials {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 28px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.dial {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.digit {\n  width: 72px;\n  height: 72px;\n  background: #0f3460;\n  border: 2px solid #e94560;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 2.2rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: #fff;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.15s;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #e94560;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.up, .down {\n  width: 72px;\n  height: 40px;\n  background: #0f3460;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  border: 1px solid #1a1a2e;\n}\n\n.up:hover, .down:hover {\n  background: #1a4a7a;\n}\n\n.up:active, .down:active {\n  background: #e94560;\n  transform: scale(0.95);\n}\n\n.open {\n  background: #e94560;\n  color: #fff;\n  padding: 14px 48px;\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 280px;\n}\n\n.open:hover {\n  background: #c73652;\n}\n\n.open:active {\n  background: #a82a42;\n  transform: scale(0.97);\n}\n\n.attempts {\n  color: #a0a0b0;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.attempts span {\n  color: #e94560;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n.message {\n  min-height: 1.5em;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n}\n\n.message.success {\n  color: #4ecca3;\n}\n\n.message.error {\n  color: #e94560;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .dials {\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .digit {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 60px;\n    font-size: 1.8rem;\n  }\n  .up, .down {\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 36px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Stylesheet for the app"
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const digits = [0, 0, 0];\nconst target = [3, 7, 2];\nlet fails = 0;\n\nconst digitEls = [\n  document.getElementById('digit0'),\n  document.getElementById('digit1'),\n  document.getElementById('digit2')\n];\nconst failCountEl = document.getElementById('failCount');\nconst messageEl = document.getElementById('message');\nconst openBtn = document.getElementById('openBtn');\n\nfunction updateDigit(index, delta) {\n  digits[index] = (digits[index] + delta + 10) % 10;\n  digitEls[index].textContent = digits[index];\n}\n\nfunction checkOpen() {\n  if (digits.every((d, i) => d === target[i])) {\n    messageEl.textContent = 'Unlocked! 🎉';\n    messageEl.className = 'message success';\n  } else {\n    fails++;\n    failCountEl.textContent = fails;\n    messageEl.textContent = 'Wrong combination. Try again.';\n    messageEl.className = 'message error';\n  }\n}\n\n// Attach event listeners to dial buttons\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.dial').forEach(dial => {\n  const index = parseInt(dial.dataset.index, 10);\n  const upBtn = dial.querySelector('.up');\n  const downBtn = dial.querySelector('.down');\n\n  upBtn.addEventListener('click', () => updateDigit(index, 1));\n  downBtn.addEventListener('click', () => updateDigit(index, -1));\n});\n\nopenBtn.addEventListener('click', checkOpen);\n\n// Keyboard support: arrow keys on focused digit area\n// (buttons already handle Enter/Space natively)",
      "description": "Game logic"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Combination Lock\n\nA simple offline browser game where you turn three dials (0–9) to match the secret combination **3-7-2** and press **Open**. Failed attempts are counted.\n\n## Features\n\n- Three dials with up/down buttons (wrap around 0↔9)\n- Open button checks the combination\n- Failed attempt counter\n- Keyboard accessible with ARIA labels\n- Responsive layout (works from 360px)\n- Pixel-style visual theme using CSS\n- No external dependencies or network requests\n\n## How to Run\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Use the ▲/▼ buttons to set each dial.\n3. Press **Open** to try the combination.\n4. The correct code is 3-7-2.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `style.css` – styling\n- `script.js` – game logic\n- `README.md` – this file\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls are native `<button>` elements with `aria-label`s.\n- Focus states are clearly visible.\n- Live regions announce digit changes and results.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Verified dial wrap-around, success/failure messages, and counter increment.\n- Tested layout at 360px width.\n- No external assets or requests.",
      "description": "Project documentation"
    }
  ]
}